# Local secret / binary files that must never be committed.
#
# Matched by EXTENSION, never by name. This file is world-readable, so a named
# entry is a public index: it tells a reader a specific document exists and is
# worth finding. Extension rules cover strictly more and disclose nothing —
# keep it that way.
*.docx
*.doc
*.xlsx
*.xls
# Office lock/owner files
~$*
# Packaged VS Code extensions
*.vsix
